Archive the linked account's Instagram conversations as chats, with up to the 20 most recent messages of each. Progress resumes on the next sync. Tokens come from the daemon environment.

Usage:
  msgvault source instagram-messages sync [identifier] [flags]

Flags:
      --build-cache        refresh analytics cache after this sync
      --full               restart from the most recent conversations; preserve and update archived rows
  -h, --help               help for sync
      --max-requests int   maximum API reads per inbox; each reads up to 25 conversations (default 1000)
      --no-build-cache     skip analytics cache refresh after this sync

Global Flags: --agent-allow-insecure, --agent-token-file, --agent-url, --config, --home, --local, --log-file, --log-level, --log-sql, --log-sql-slow-ms, --no-log-file, -v/--verbose (see 'msgvault --help')
